1
00:00:12,360 --> 00:00:13,240
Is that you?

2
00:00:13,240 --> 00:00:14,240
I think so.

3
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:16,800
Cui Yihang.

4
00:00:18,720 --> 00:00:20,400
That balloon makes him look so funny.

5
00:00:23,560 --> 00:00:24,720
(Hello)
We both happened

6
00:00:24,720 --> 00:00:25,680
to wear white that day.

7
00:00:25,680 --> 00:00:26,440
Hello.

8
00:00:26,440 --> 00:00:27,640
(Imitating)
I think

9
00:00:27,640 --> 00:00:28,360
(This is for you)
this is one

10
00:00:28,360 --> 00:00:30,000
(Thanks)
of Cui Yihang's coolest moments.

11
00:00:30,480 --> 00:00:31,600
He instantly gets cooler

12
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:32,920
when he's with Si.

13
00:00:34,830 --> 00:00:36,740
There should've been more balloons,
but...

14
00:00:37,380 --> 00:00:38,300
(Looks up)

15
00:00:38,460 --> 00:00:39,860
(One of a kind)

16
00:00:39,860 --> 00:00:40,840
When I opened the door,

17
00:00:40,840 --> 00:00:42,000
they all...

18
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:42,680
Flew away?

19
00:00:42,680 --> 00:00:42,970
Yeah.

20
00:00:49,180 --> 00:00:49,840
Oh my gosh.

21
00:00:50,960 --> 00:00:52,440
Did you see how it flew away?

22
00:00:52,440 --> 00:00:53,480
No, I didn't.

23
00:00:53,480 --> 00:00:54,240
It's my first time seeing that.

24
00:00:54,680 --> 00:00:55,760
That was so funny.

25
00:00:55,760 --> 00:00:56,720
That was hilarious.

26
00:01:01,140 --> 00:01:01,600
This is...

27
00:01:05,020 --> 00:01:06,900
(Helping)

28
00:01:07,050 --> 00:01:08,620
I don't think this can hang here.

29
00:01:08,840 --> 00:01:10,060
It'll fly this way.

30
00:01:10,060 --> 00:01:11,120
It keeps going this way, right?

31
00:01:11,120 --> 00:01:11,680
Yeah.

32
00:01:16,180 --> 00:01:16,820
(Looks down)

33
00:01:19,800 --> 00:01:21,000
Cui Yihang got shy too.

34
00:01:22,080 --> 00:01:23,480
That balloon kept getting

35
00:01:23,480 --> 00:01:25,080
in the way that day.

36
00:01:25,080 --> 00:01:26,280
He thought you two were being too quiet,

37
00:01:26,280 --> 00:01:28,160
so he brought a balloon along
to liven things up.

38
00:01:29,800 --> 00:01:31,360
I was really looking forward

39
00:01:31,360 --> 00:01:33,180
to being alone with you.

40
00:01:38,960 --> 00:01:40,120
He often doesn't know

41
00:01:40,120 --> 00:01:41,200
what to say.

42
00:01:41,200 --> 00:01:42,640
And I don't know what to say either.

43
00:01:43,200 --> 00:01:44,480
You two are both pretty quiet.

44
00:01:52,710 --> 00:01:54,700
Do you feel like anything's different?

45
00:01:56,040 --> 00:01:56,840
Who do you mean?

46
00:01:57,340 --> 00:01:57,930
Me.

47
00:01:57,930 --> 00:01:58,360
You?

48
00:01:59,700 --> 00:02:03,220
(Sits up straight)

49
00:02:05,500 --> 00:02:06,570
What's different from usual?

50
00:02:07,960 --> 00:02:08,920
Where's your mole?

51
00:02:11,900 --> 00:02:13,090
Do you want to take a look
and see who I am?

52
00:02:14,040 --> 00:02:15,240
This sounds familiar.

53
00:02:15,240 --> 00:02:16,840
The first time

54
00:02:16,840 --> 00:02:18,440
I met Chen Hewen and Sun Bohan,

55
00:02:18,440 --> 00:02:19,680
I asked if they noticed anything
different about me.

56
00:02:19,680 --> 00:02:21,240
And you ended up
saying the exact same thing.

57
00:02:22,360 --> 00:02:22,920
He said

58
00:02:22,920 --> 00:02:23,880
he wanted to see who you were.

59
00:02:24,440 --> 00:02:25,040
I just wanted to say

60
00:02:25,040 --> 00:02:26,280
my hair looked different that day.

61
00:02:26,280 --> 00:02:28,040
I wasn't asking him
if he knew who I was.

62
00:02:28,040 --> 00:02:29,520
I wanted to tell him
I'd changed my hairstyle.

63
00:02:29,520 --> 00:02:30,560
He didn't even notice.

64
00:02:31,840 --> 00:02:33,520
Si can be a little playful too.

65
00:02:35,520 --> 00:02:36,010
Right here.

66
00:02:38,970 --> 00:02:39,900
I think this one is much better.

67
00:02:39,900 --> 00:02:40,880
Much better.

68
00:02:40,980 --> 00:02:44,900
(Better)

69
00:02:44,920 --> 00:02:46,800
What did you think
of the drawing back then?

70
00:02:46,800 --> 00:02:49,040
(Too abstract)
I thought it was a little too abstract.

71
00:02:51,240 --> 00:02:53,120
But it was hard to criticize him for it.

72
00:02:53,800 --> 00:02:54,560
He was really

73
00:02:54,560 --> 00:02:55,680
serious about it.

74
00:02:55,680 --> 00:02:57,040
He spent quite a while drawing it.

75
00:02:57,040 --> 00:02:57,760
You had to give him some praise.

76
00:02:57,760 --> 00:02:58,000
Yeah.

77
00:02:58,000 --> 00:02:58,660
You had to give him some praise.

78
00:02:58,660 --> 00:02:59,640
But it was pretty abstract.

79
00:02:59,840 --> 00:03:01,200
I didn't expect him

80
00:03:01,200 --> 00:03:02,800
to be this calm

81
00:03:02,800 --> 00:03:04,400
and gentle.

82
00:03:04,400 --> 00:03:05,880
What kind of person do you think he is

83
00:03:05,880 --> 00:03:08,000
after spending a few days
with him at Signal House?

84
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:10,320
Just like you described him.

85
00:03:10,320 --> 00:03:12,800
Like a cheetah.

86
00:03:12,800 --> 00:03:14,240
But he really isn't like that.

87
00:03:14,240 --> 00:03:16,560
We both speak pretty softly.

88
00:03:16,560 --> 00:03:18,120
A lot of the time,
I can't quite hear him,

89
00:03:18,120 --> 00:03:19,160
and he can't quite hear me either.

90
00:03:21,880 --> 00:03:22,900
There are just so many things

91
00:03:22,900 --> 00:03:24,010
I'd never expect.

92
00:03:24,010 --> 00:03:25,250
You're pretty special.

93
00:03:25,580 --> 00:03:27,380
And that makes me feel
a little surprised.

94
00:03:27,540 --> 00:03:29,420
(Feeling surprised)

95
00:03:29,420 --> 00:03:29,940
Okay.

96
00:03:30,330 --> 00:03:31,020
I like it.

97
00:03:31,020 --> 00:03:33,460
(I like it)

98
00:03:37,380 --> 00:03:38,540
(What are you laughing at?)
Why are you laughing?

99
00:03:39,560 --> 00:03:41,680
(Oh my gosh)
I've never seen this side of you before.

100
00:03:41,680 --> 00:03:42,560
What side?

101
00:03:44,320 --> 00:03:46,160
You've never been this shy around me.

102
00:03:46,800 --> 00:03:48,320
I've never seen you
make that face before.

103
00:03:48,320 --> 00:03:49,800
Why would I be shy around you?

104
00:03:52,120 --> 00:03:53,600
Just wait.
We'll see your date scene later.

105
00:03:56,420 --> 00:03:57,460
When we're

106
00:03:57,460 --> 00:03:59,230
cooking together,

107
00:03:59,640 --> 00:04:01,470
or when you're driving,

108
00:04:01,810 --> 00:04:03,000
or when it's just the two of us.

109
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:03,730
I feel

110
00:04:04,560 --> 00:04:05,550
really safe with you.

111
00:04:06,460 --> 00:04:07,480
Have you ever had donkey meat pastries?

112
00:04:07,480 --> 00:04:08,390
(Cui Yihang
bought the donkey meat pastries)

113
00:04:08,390 --> 00:04:08,940
No.

114
00:04:09,330 --> 00:04:10,060
You've never had it?

115
00:04:10,060 --> 00:04:10,680
Never.

116
00:04:10,920 --> 00:04:12,160
I'll let you try something different.

117
00:04:12,220 --> 00:04:14,260
(I'll let you try something different)

118
00:04:14,440 --> 00:04:15,180
Is there anything you can't reach?

119
00:04:15,180 --> 00:04:15,740
(Asking)

120
00:04:16,020 --> 00:04:17,290
I want to try those fries.

121
00:04:18,520 --> 00:04:19,060
Take two.

122
00:04:19,060 --> 00:04:19,850
(Hands over)
One is enough.

123
00:04:25,560 --> 00:04:26,720
It's a sweet moment.

124
00:04:26,720 --> 00:04:27,120
What's wrong?

125
00:04:29,040 --> 00:04:30,520
Don't cry, Si.

126
00:04:31,170 --> 00:04:32,000
Oh my.

127
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:33,000
Our fairy is crying.

128
00:04:33,360 --> 00:04:34,360
Because Xing

129
00:04:34,360 --> 00:04:36,280
wasn't at Signal House at first.

130
00:04:36,280 --> 00:04:37,720
And

131
00:04:37,720 --> 00:04:41,000
I guess having Cui Yihang around

132
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:43,040
made me feel safe.

133
00:04:43,520 --> 00:04:44,400
When Xing wasn't there,

134
00:04:44,400 --> 00:04:45,120
I didn't know

135
00:04:45,120 --> 00:04:47,400
how to be

136
00:04:47,400 --> 00:04:49,520
with so many people there.

137
00:04:49,520 --> 00:04:51,320
It was actually the first time
we had been apart.

138
00:04:52,280 --> 00:04:52,640
At that time,

139
00:04:52,640 --> 00:04:54,480
I'd just talk to Meng every day.

140
00:04:55,400 --> 00:04:56,120
Yeah.

141
00:04:56,120 --> 00:04:56,840
Yeah, exactly.

142
00:04:56,840 --> 00:04:58,000
Spending time with Cui Yihang

143
00:04:58,000 --> 00:04:59,600
made me realize

144
00:04:59,600 --> 00:05:01,000
I'd instinctively look for him

145
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:01,960
whenever I came back to Signal House.

146
00:05:02,920 --> 00:05:04,080
So even though I told him

147
00:05:04,080 --> 00:05:05,880
I felt safe around him,

148
00:05:05,880 --> 00:05:07,160
I said it really quietly.

149
00:05:08,080 --> 00:05:09,800
Yeah, I said it really quietly.

150
00:05:15,240 --> 00:05:16,240
What's wrong with you?

151
00:05:18,360 --> 00:05:20,840
I'd never seen this side of you before.

152
00:05:21,520 --> 00:05:23,760
Seeing you this happy

153
00:05:23,760 --> 00:05:25,040
makes me really happy too.

154
00:05:26,200 --> 00:05:27,200
Come on, don't cry.

155
00:05:29,480 --> 00:05:31,360
So, what do you think of Cui Yihang?

156
00:05:33,600 --> 00:05:34,680
What do you think?

157
00:05:34,680 --> 00:05:35,880
I think he's pretty great.

158
00:05:37,320 --> 00:05:38,760
You probably didn't get

159
00:05:38,760 --> 00:05:40,000
to know him much at first.

160
00:05:41,240 --> 00:05:42,240
But watching the footage,

161
00:05:42,240 --> 00:05:43,360
I realized he actually has

162
00:05:44,080 --> 00:05:45,560
a pretty unexpected side to him.

163
00:05:46,760 --> 00:05:47,640
And he's pretty reserved

164
00:05:47,640 --> 00:05:49,120
around everyone else.

165
00:05:52,240 --> 00:05:53,160
Your face.

166
00:05:53,160 --> 00:05:53,760
You know...

167
00:05:53,760 --> 00:05:54,640
What's wrong with my face?

168
00:05:55,680 --> 00:05:56,520
You've got a runny nose.

169
00:05:58,960 --> 00:05:59,760
Let's keep watching.

170
00:06:02,520 --> 00:06:03,840
Do I need a touch-up?

171
00:06:03,840 --> 00:06:04,640
No need.

172
00:06:10,420 --> 00:06:11,180
It's up!

173
00:06:14,370 --> 00:06:15,300
It really is up!

174
00:06:18,480 --> 00:06:19,400
So beautiful.

175
00:06:19,400 --> 00:06:20,640
So sweet.

176
00:06:28,760 --> 00:06:30,840
I remember a lot of viewers were asking

177
00:06:30,840 --> 00:06:31,600
when they'd finally get to see

178
00:06:31,600 --> 00:06:32,920
Si really laugh.

179
00:06:32,920 --> 00:06:33,820
Well, you're about to see it.

180
00:06:33,820 --> 00:06:34,700
Yeah, I was laughing pretty hard.

181
00:06:34,700 --> 00:06:36,480
Yeah, you're grinning from ear to ear.

182
00:06:36,480 --> 00:06:38,080
Yeah, definitely.

183
00:06:38,080 --> 00:06:40,280
Si is actually funnier on dates.

184
00:06:40,280 --> 00:06:41,480
I felt a little more reserved

185
00:06:41,480 --> 00:06:42,240
around everyone,

186
00:06:42,880 --> 00:06:43,640
but when I'm with Cui Yihang,

187
00:06:43,640 --> 00:06:45,040
I can be more like myself.

188
00:06:45,040 --> 00:06:45,640
Yeah.

189
00:06:46,120 --> 00:06:47,640
I think whenever

190
00:06:47,640 --> 00:06:49,320
we're alone together,

191
00:06:49,320 --> 00:06:50,760
it's always pretty quiet.

192
00:06:50,760 --> 00:06:52,240
That's how everyone describes us.

193
00:06:52,720 --> 00:06:55,000
And I like joking around with him.

194
00:06:55,480 --> 00:06:55,920
Maybe

195
00:06:55,920 --> 00:06:57,520
we just have good chemistry.

196
00:06:57,520 --> 00:07:00,160
And we both speak so softly.

197
00:07:00,160 --> 00:07:00,920
We can't hear each other.

198
00:07:00,920 --> 00:07:02,480
Sometimes I can barely hear him.

199
00:07:04,400 --> 00:07:05,880
There was that part
where he brought donkey meat pastries.

200
00:07:05,880 --> 00:07:07,080
I don't know if you guys noticed.

201
00:07:07,920 --> 00:07:09,440
He said there was something different.

202
00:07:09,440 --> 00:07:10,920
Honestly, I didn't hear him.

203
00:07:10,920 --> 00:07:11,480
I couldn't make it out.

204
00:07:11,480 --> 00:07:12,560
All I heard
was him telling me to eat it.

205
00:07:12,560 --> 00:07:13,120
He wanted me to try it.

206
00:07:16,500 --> 00:07:18,060
You seem

207
00:07:18,210 --> 00:07:19,590
quiet and reserved,

208
00:07:19,590 --> 00:07:21,120
but you also have

209
00:07:22,520 --> 00:07:24,240
some impulsive thoughts and actions.

210
00:07:24,890 --> 00:07:26,240
I think so.

211
00:07:28,380 --> 00:07:29,690
Have you ever acted
on impulse at Signal House?

212
00:07:31,090 --> 00:07:31,700
Of course.

213
00:07:32,080 --> 00:07:33,160
What do you mean

214
00:07:33,160 --> 00:07:34,080
by impulsive?

215
00:07:34,080 --> 00:07:35,240
(Shy)
Was it writing him

216
00:07:35,240 --> 00:07:35,960
a card?

217
00:07:35,960 --> 00:07:37,960
For someone like me,

218
00:07:37,960 --> 00:07:39,280
even going to look for him

219
00:07:39,280 --> 00:07:40,200
would count as being impulsive.

220
00:07:40,200 --> 00:07:40,840
That's what I think.

221
00:07:43,740 --> 00:07:46,060
(Follow PD)

222
00:07:47,810 --> 00:07:48,460
Wait a second.

223
00:07:48,940 --> 00:07:49,260
(Leaves)

224
00:07:52,020 --> 00:07:53,660
(Tears up)

225
00:07:55,620 --> 00:07:56,820
(Grabs tissues)

226
00:08:09,070 --> 00:08:10,100
What's wrong?

227
00:08:10,100 --> 00:08:11,580
(Worried)
I'm fine.

228
00:08:12,520 --> 00:08:14,210
(Hands over tissues)
Xing just called me.

229
00:08:14,500 --> 00:08:15,500
She's not feeling well.

230
00:08:15,720 --> 00:08:16,660
So she went to the hospital.

231
00:08:17,820 --> 00:08:19,320
Then maybe we should...

232
00:08:21,630 --> 00:08:22,870
Maybe we should go over there first.

233
00:08:22,870 --> 00:08:24,050
You seem really worried.

234
00:08:24,050 --> 00:08:24,620
Okay.

235
00:08:33,520 --> 00:08:35,840
Actually, it happened very suddenly.

236
00:08:36,640 --> 00:08:37,200
Before that,

237
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:38,720
I might've had some stomach pain.

238
00:08:38,720 --> 00:08:40,480
But the staff got me

239
00:08:40,480 --> 00:08:42,080
to the hospital right away.

240
00:08:42,840 --> 00:08:44,280
And I had a date that day.

241
00:08:44,280 --> 00:08:44,800
Yeah.

242
00:08:44,800 --> 00:08:46,280
When I got to the hospital,

243
00:08:46,280 --> 00:08:47,640
I was lying in a hospital bed.

244
00:08:47,640 --> 00:08:48,240
And I told the doctor

245
00:08:48,240 --> 00:08:50,320
I had a date that day

246
00:08:50,320 --> 00:08:51,600
and needed to leave.

247
00:08:52,040 --> 00:08:53,200
I didn't want to stay in the hospital.

248
00:08:53,200 --> 00:08:54,360
And the doctor said no.

249
00:08:54,360 --> 00:08:55,360
Oh my.

250
00:08:55,360 --> 00:08:57,200
It was actually pretty serious.

251
00:08:57,200 --> 00:08:58,640
Yeah. It happened so suddenly.

252
00:08:58,640 --> 00:08:59,880
But luckily,
I got to the hospital in time.

253
00:09:00,560 --> 00:09:01,840
While I was in the hospital,

254
00:09:01,840 --> 00:09:02,720
my PD (director)

255
00:09:02,720 --> 00:09:04,080
stayed with me

256
00:09:04,080 --> 00:09:06,400
all the time.

257
00:09:06,400 --> 00:09:07,840
Si's PD (director) did too.

258
00:09:09,120 --> 00:09:10,680
They were always there for me.

259
00:09:10,680 --> 00:09:12,480
Si would come to the hospital to see me.

260
00:09:13,520 --> 00:09:15,640
One of the producers even brought

261
00:09:15,640 --> 00:09:16,720
a folding chair

262
00:09:16,720 --> 00:09:18,440
and put it right next
to my hospital bed.

263
00:09:19,000 --> 00:09:20,680
They stayed there
with me every single day.

264
00:09:22,280 --> 00:09:23,440
For as many days
as I was in the hospital,

265
00:09:23,440 --> 00:09:24,400
the staff stayed

266
00:09:24,400 --> 00:09:25,840
right by my side.

267
00:09:25,840 --> 00:09:27,120
And there were flowers

268
00:09:27,120 --> 00:09:28,520
all around my bed.

269
00:09:28,520 --> 00:09:29,560
They'd bring flowers
every time they came.

270
00:09:29,560 --> 00:09:30,480
Meng also

271
00:09:30,480 --> 00:09:31,520
brought me flowers.

272
00:09:32,720 --> 00:09:34,840
When Xing first went into the hospital,

273
00:09:34,840 --> 00:09:36,120
neither of us had ever been through

274
00:09:36,120 --> 00:09:36,960
anything like this.

275
00:09:36,960 --> 00:09:37,720
Once we got there,

276
00:09:37,720 --> 00:09:40,160
the staff handled everything,

277
00:09:40,160 --> 00:09:41,000
including all the paperwork

278
00:09:41,000 --> 00:09:42,280
for her surgery.

279
00:09:43,400 --> 00:09:45,600
I'm really grateful to them.

280
00:09:47,640 --> 00:09:49,840
I'm just glad you're better now.

281
00:09:50,120 --> 00:09:51,800
Yeah. Si and I went
for a follow-up yesterday,

282
00:09:51,800 --> 00:09:53,520
and the doctor said
I'm recovering really well.

283
00:09:53,520 --> 00:09:54,840
That's good.

284
00:09:54,840 --> 00:09:55,960
I think it's really important

285
00:09:55,960 --> 00:09:57,760
for everyone to eat their meals on time.

286
00:09:58,240 --> 00:09:58,640
Okay.

287
00:09:58,880 --> 00:10:01,160
And keep a regular schedule.

288
00:10:01,160 --> 00:10:02,680
So you'll get

289
00:10:02,680 --> 00:10:03,680
to go on those dates.

290
00:10:07,160 --> 00:10:08,880
Let's get back to watching.

291
00:10:10,780 --> 00:10:12,600
(Emergency.
Wu Siying talks with the doctor)

292
00:10:12,600 --> 00:10:13,200
You don't need to

293
00:10:13,200 --> 00:10:13,860
worry about that.

294
00:10:13,860 --> 00:10:14,970
I'm not. No.

295
00:10:16,130 --> 00:10:17,050
It's okay.

296
00:10:17,300 --> 00:10:18,120
You don't need

297
00:10:18,120 --> 00:10:18,900
to worry too much.

298
00:10:19,280 --> 00:10:20,670
This is a very common condition.

299
00:10:20,670 --> 00:10:21,270
You understand?

300
00:10:21,270 --> 00:10:22,610
Don't be too upset.

301
00:10:22,610 --> 00:10:24,280
It's not that serious.

302
00:10:24,920 --> 00:10:25,690
The ulcer broke

303
00:10:25,690 --> 00:10:27,260
through the serosal layer
of her stomach wall,

304
00:10:27,520 --> 00:10:29,320
which is why her abdomen hurts so badly.

305
00:10:30,400 --> 00:10:31,230
Okay, let's get the consent signed.

306
00:10:31,230 --> 00:10:32,410
Once it's signed,
we'll get everything ready.

307
00:10:32,720 --> 00:10:33,840
Is this what he told you

308
00:10:33,840 --> 00:10:34,920
before you signed?

309
00:10:34,920 --> 00:10:35,720
Yeah.

310
00:10:36,920 --> 00:10:38,640
When

311
00:10:38,640 --> 00:10:39,520
the doctor

312
00:10:39,520 --> 00:10:40,880
was wheeling me into the operating room,

313
00:10:40,880 --> 00:10:43,280
I saw Si

314
00:10:43,280 --> 00:10:44,520
and the doctor.

315
00:10:44,960 --> 00:10:46,040
The doctor asked her
to sign the form,

316
00:10:46,040 --> 00:10:47,320
and she just started crying.

317
00:10:50,400 --> 00:10:51,440
When I was signing,

318
00:10:51,440 --> 00:10:52,560
I suddenly...

319
00:10:53,520 --> 00:10:54,520
It just hit me

320
00:10:56,160 --> 00:10:57,560
that I was facing this all on my own.

321
00:10:57,560 --> 00:10:58,280
I'd never been through

322
00:10:58,280 --> 00:10:59,440
anything like this before.

323
00:11:00,240 --> 00:11:02,520
And you two had always been together
since you were kids.

324
00:11:04,640 --> 00:11:06,060
Have you talked to Xing?

325
00:11:06,810 --> 00:11:07,280
No.

326
00:11:07,760 --> 00:11:08,640
I have no idea.

327
00:11:08,640 --> 00:11:09,360
She didn't tell you?

328
00:11:09,360 --> 00:11:10,330
I still don't know anything.

329
00:11:11,660 --> 00:11:12,740
We'll wait for the news.

330
00:11:13,320 --> 00:11:16,440
Sun Bohan was so scared
he could barely walk.

331
00:11:16,440 --> 00:11:17,560
He was like a robot at that point.

332
00:11:17,560 --> 00:11:18,680
He was genuinely scared.

333
00:11:18,680 --> 00:11:20,920
You could tell how worried he was.

334
00:11:20,920 --> 00:11:22,380
He could barely even walk straight.

335
00:11:22,380 --> 00:11:23,060
(Rubbing)

336
00:11:23,060 --> 00:11:24,140
It makes me feel sorry for her,

337
00:11:24,140 --> 00:11:25,390
then guilty,

338
00:11:26,290 --> 00:11:27,740
but at the same time,

339
00:11:27,740 --> 00:11:29,140
I just want to take care of her.

340
00:11:30,130 --> 00:11:31,760
If you already have feelings for her,

341
00:11:31,760 --> 00:11:32,660
that guilt can actually deepen

342
00:11:32,660 --> 00:11:33,650
and strengthen your relationship.

343
00:11:33,650 --> 00:11:34,420
Yeah.

344
00:11:34,420 --> 00:11:35,940
That day, she knocked on my door

345
00:11:35,940 --> 00:11:37,640
to deliver the invitation.

346
00:11:38,180 --> 00:11:38,950
When she turned around,

347
00:11:38,950 --> 00:11:40,170
I noticed her ponytail.

348
00:11:47,600 --> 00:11:48,950
it really was just a moment.

349
00:11:48,950 --> 00:11:49,960
Yeah, just that moment.

350
00:11:51,190 --> 00:11:51,960
It hit you right in the heart.

351
00:11:51,960 --> 00:11:52,860
That's really how it felt.

352
00:11:52,860 --> 00:11:53,460
Yeah.

353
00:11:55,480 --> 00:11:56,720
He also

354
00:11:56,720 --> 00:11:57,920
told me

355
00:11:57,920 --> 00:12:00,280
the same things he just said.

356
00:12:00,880 --> 00:12:02,200
I couldn't see it for myself,

357
00:12:02,200 --> 00:12:03,520
but I could imagine it.

358
00:12:03,520 --> 00:12:05,040
That's just the kind of person he is.

359
00:12:05,040 --> 00:12:06,680
He's very sincere,

360
00:12:06,680 --> 00:12:08,480
and he's also really empathetic.

361
00:12:09,440 --> 00:12:10,640
It still really moved me.

362
00:12:12,060 --> 00:12:13,420
(Peeking out to look)

363
00:12:13,420 --> 00:12:16,660
(Emergency)

364
00:12:28,010 --> 00:12:28,520
She's okay.

365
00:12:28,520 --> 00:12:29,560
She's fine now.

366
00:12:29,560 --> 00:12:30,160
She's fine.

367
00:12:30,430 --> 00:12:31,300
And Xing wanted me

368
00:12:31,600 --> 00:12:32,920
to tell you before her surgery.

369
00:12:32,920 --> 00:12:33,900
The flowers you gave her

370
00:12:33,900 --> 00:12:35,400
are the same color as her outfit today.

371
00:13:03,920 --> 00:13:05,400
I think Xing is so sweet.

372
00:13:05,400 --> 00:13:08,440
She had you pass along a message to him,

373
00:13:08,440 --> 00:13:10,360
saying her outfit matched the color

374
00:13:10,360 --> 00:13:12,560
of the flowers he gave her.

375
00:13:12,560 --> 00:13:13,360
That really got me.

376
00:13:13,360 --> 00:13:14,520
Totally.

377
00:13:14,880 --> 00:13:16,160
They waited downstairs that day

378
00:13:16,160 --> 00:13:17,920
for almost five hours.

379
00:13:19,680 --> 00:13:21,800
We found out Xing needed surgery

380
00:13:21,800 --> 00:13:24,040
after we got back to Signal House.

381
00:13:24,480 --> 00:13:26,560
Everyone was really worried.

382
00:13:27,480 --> 00:13:28,720
We asked Cui Yihang and Sun Bohan

383
00:13:28,720 --> 00:13:30,240
about it at the time.

384
00:13:31,120 --> 00:13:32,560
Then Si told us

385
00:13:32,560 --> 00:13:33,360
the next day.

386
00:13:33,360 --> 00:13:34,800
Neither of them had said anything.

387
00:13:35,200 --> 00:13:36,080
When I came back,

388
00:13:36,080 --> 00:13:36,760
everyone was really worried.

389
00:13:36,760 --> 00:13:37,560
I was in the kitchen,

390
00:13:37,560 --> 00:13:38,760
getting ready to make something,

391
00:13:38,760 --> 00:13:40,120
when they all came over and asked

392
00:13:40,120 --> 00:13:41,240
what happened.

393
00:13:41,560 --> 00:13:42,720
So I told everyone

394
00:13:42,720 --> 00:13:43,480
you'd had a minor surgery.

395
00:13:46,080 --> 00:13:46,920
So sad we didn't get to have you

396
00:13:46,920 --> 00:13:48,840
stay at Signal House
for a few more days.

397
00:13:48,840 --> 00:13:50,720
Yeah, I was really sad about that too.

398
00:13:51,560 --> 00:13:53,020
We all wrote you notes.

399
00:13:53,020 --> 00:13:54,037
- Did you read them?
- I got them.

400
00:13:54,037 --> 00:13:55,720
I was crying while I read them.

401
00:13:56,960 --> 00:13:57,640
Don't cry.

402
00:13:57,920 --> 00:13:59,480
I read every single one.

403
00:14:00,360 --> 00:14:01,760
I'm all better now.

404
00:14:02,280 --> 00:14:02,920
The doctor at her follow-up

405
00:14:02,920 --> 00:14:04,440
couldn't even tell she'd had surgery.

406
00:14:04,440 --> 00:14:06,120
Then we had hot pot that afternoon.

407
00:14:06,120 --> 00:14:06,520
Yeah.

408
00:14:06,520 --> 00:14:07,000
That's good.

409
00:14:07,000 --> 00:14:07,920
That's really good.

410
00:14:07,920 --> 00:14:08,680
We had a split hot pot.

411
00:14:08,680 --> 00:14:09,720
She had the spicy broth.

412
00:14:09,720 --> 00:14:10,680
You had the plain broth.

413
00:14:10,680 --> 00:14:11,400
She had the tomato broth.

414
00:14:11,400 --> 00:14:12,200
The tomato one.

415
00:14:16,200 --> 00:14:17,420
You can hit it here.

416
00:14:17,420 --> 00:14:18,930
Right in this corner.

417
00:14:19,330 --> 00:14:19,830
Sure.

418
00:14:19,830 --> 00:14:20,970
Let's both hit the corner here.

419
00:14:20,970 --> 00:14:21,500
Okay.

420
00:14:22,030 --> 00:14:23,990
We do all kinds of fun stuff every day.

421
00:14:33,240 --> 00:14:35,640
What are these two doing?

422
00:14:35,640 --> 00:14:36,960
(Work on your thesis)
While I'm sleeping.

423
00:14:37,680 --> 00:14:38,800
Cao Yiheng is trying not to laugh.

424
00:14:49,800 --> 00:14:51,200
I think the way I felt back then

425
00:14:51,200 --> 00:14:52,360
was probably because

426
00:14:52,360 --> 00:14:55,040
even though I told him at the time

427
00:14:55,920 --> 00:14:57,280
that we should just be friends,

428
00:14:57,280 --> 00:14:59,720
while we were still in Signal House,

429
00:14:59,720 --> 00:15:01,360
I probably couldn't just

430
00:15:01,360 --> 00:15:02,720
- pull myself out of it that quickly.
- I get it.

431
00:15:02,720 --> 00:15:05,360
So I think I was still a little sad.

432
00:15:08,240 --> 00:15:09,960
You guys were having fun today.

433
00:15:10,280 --> 00:15:11,360
You were all together?

434
00:15:12,570 --> 00:15:14,000
The four of you were together?

435
00:15:14,000 --> 00:15:15,540
- Just the two of us.
- No.

436
00:15:15,540 --> 00:15:16,900
They had something come up.

437
00:15:17,560 --> 00:15:18,460
- Yeah.
- Really?

438
00:15:18,920 --> 00:15:20,080
He was trying to cover it up.

439
00:15:20,080 --> 00:15:20,600
Yeah.

440
00:15:21,770 --> 00:15:22,370
How about you guys?

441
00:15:22,370 --> 00:15:23,240
Where did you go today?

442
00:15:23,440 --> 00:15:24,600
He was actually a little upset.

443
00:15:24,600 --> 00:15:25,920
(We went to a pet park)
But he quickly asked Zhao Xilun

444
00:15:25,920 --> 00:15:27,390
(I brought my dog out)
where they went.

445
00:15:28,590 --> 00:15:29,670
Did you guys...

446
00:15:29,670 --> 00:15:30,220
You...

447
00:15:30,220 --> 00:15:31,540
You didn't go?

448
00:15:32,390 --> 00:15:33,610
No, something came up.

449
00:15:34,950 --> 00:15:35,490
They...

450
00:15:36,470 --> 00:15:37,730
Yeah, uh...

451
00:15:37,730 --> 00:15:38,800
Something with Xing.

452
00:15:40,120 --> 00:15:40,800
She's okay, right?

453
00:15:42,160 --> 00:15:42,670
She's fine.

454
00:15:45,060 --> 00:15:46,590
So where'd you guys go?

455
00:15:48,470 --> 00:15:48,800
What?

456
00:15:56,390 --> 00:15:57,050
You...

457
00:15:57,050 --> 00:15:58,160
What's wrong?

458
00:15:58,160 --> 00:15:58,790
What happened?

459
00:16:05,300 --> 00:16:05,970
It's okay.

460
00:16:14,600 --> 00:16:15,280
Yeah, actually,

461
00:16:15,280 --> 00:16:16,320
Bohan and Yihang didn't say anything.

462
00:16:16,320 --> 00:16:17,200
When I learned that,

463
00:16:17,200 --> 00:16:18,120
I was really touched.

464
00:16:18,120 --> 00:16:19,320
They probably knew

465
00:16:19,320 --> 00:16:20,800
what we're like,

466
00:16:20,800 --> 00:16:22,480
and maybe they wanted to protect us.

467
00:16:23,320 --> 00:16:24,640
They didn't want everyone
to know about it,

468
00:16:24,640 --> 00:16:26,680
so they chose not to say anything.

469
00:16:29,010 --> 00:16:30,820
Let's ask Sun Bohan what's going on.

470
00:16:35,600 --> 00:16:36,370
What is he doing?

471
00:16:36,370 --> 00:16:37,310
Hello? Anyone there?

472
00:16:37,320 --> 00:16:39,560
(Who is it?)
Why is everyone being so sneaky?

473
00:16:41,090 --> 00:16:42,150
It's Chen Hewen.

474
00:16:44,360 --> 00:16:44,950
I'm right here.

475
00:16:47,400 --> 00:16:48,030
Where are you?

476
00:16:48,030 --> 00:16:48,570
Right here.

477
00:16:50,920 --> 00:16:52,480
Is Chen Hewen waiting for Sha Yue'er?

478
00:16:53,560 --> 00:16:55,040
Can't he just come out?

479
00:16:55,040 --> 00:16:55,880
I don't know.

480
00:16:55,880 --> 00:16:57,080
Can't he just come out?

481
00:16:57,080 --> 00:16:57,760
Meng, do you know

482
00:16:57,760 --> 00:16:59,240
where that voice came from?

483
00:16:59,240 --> 00:17:00,480
At the time, I was just...

484
00:17:00,480 --> 00:17:01,840
I kind of forgot.

485
00:17:01,840 --> 00:17:03,000
But later, I realized it was him.

486
00:17:03,000 --> 00:17:04,640
It was honestly so funny.

487
00:17:07,060 --> 00:17:08,970
Why didn't Xing and Si come back?

488
00:17:10,400 --> 00:17:11,480
Something came up.

489
00:17:12,940 --> 00:17:13,820
What's wrong with you?

490
00:17:15,100 --> 00:17:16,060
Nothing, really.

491
00:17:16,060 --> 00:17:16,920
We were just...

492
00:17:17,760 --> 00:17:18,620
What was it?

493
00:17:18,620 --> 00:17:19,580
We talked for a bit.

494
00:17:22,350 --> 00:17:23,360
- Okay.
- Oh my.

495
00:17:23,900 --> 00:17:24,700
Thanks for checking on us.

496
00:17:24,700 --> 00:17:25,640
We'll just...

497
00:17:26,050 --> 00:17:26,780
You know...

498
00:17:26,780 --> 00:17:27,580
Rest for a bit.

499
00:17:28,070 --> 00:17:29,050
It's fine. Really.

500
00:17:30,200 --> 00:17:31,160
And you're still laughing at him?

501
00:17:31,160 --> 00:17:31,560
Then I... I'll...

502
00:17:31,560 --> 00:17:33,440
I've never seen this side of him.

503
00:17:33,440 --> 00:17:36,200
He found the bed closest to the door,

504
00:17:36,200 --> 00:17:37,600
but from an angle you guys couldn't see,

505
00:17:37,600 --> 00:17:38,880
and hid in there.

506
00:17:38,880 --> 00:17:39,760
Yeah.

507
00:17:39,760 --> 00:17:41,080
He started crying right away.

508
00:17:41,720 --> 00:17:42,560
Maybe he felt safer

509
00:17:42,560 --> 00:17:43,840
in that corner,

510
00:17:43,840 --> 00:17:45,440
so he just hid there.

511
00:17:45,880 --> 00:17:47,640
Sun Bohan was really falling apart.

512
00:17:47,640 --> 00:17:49,960
Even though I hadn't been
at Signal House

513
00:17:50,560 --> 00:17:51,160
for very long,

514
00:17:51,160 --> 00:17:52,440
everyone

515
00:17:52,440 --> 00:17:53,520
still remembered me.

516
00:17:53,520 --> 00:17:54,680
That really touched me.

517
00:17:56,960 --> 00:17:59,480
I'm really grateful to have you guys.

518
00:17:59,480 --> 00:18:01,680
When Xing wasn't around, I had you guys.

519
00:18:01,680 --> 00:18:03,840
And when Xing came,

520
00:18:04,400 --> 00:18:06,800
you all took care of both of us.

521
00:18:06,800 --> 00:18:08,880
We're really grateful to have you guys.

522
00:18:08,880 --> 00:18:09,960
Especially Meng.

523
00:18:11,080 --> 00:18:12,400
Si, I just remembered something.

524
00:18:12,400 --> 00:18:14,680
You said you were really grateful

525
00:18:14,680 --> 00:18:16,360
that we found you hiding in that corner.

526
00:18:16,360 --> 00:18:17,120
But in our hearts,

527
00:18:17,120 --> 00:18:19,280
you're not someone
who belongs in the corner.

528
00:18:19,280 --> 00:18:20,440
You're someone who means a lot to us.

529
00:18:20,440 --> 00:18:21,880
- So don't ever think that way.
-Yeah.

530
00:18:24,240 --> 00:18:25,320
Yeah.

531
00:18:27,010 --> 00:18:28,160
(Via ferrata starting point)
This is our starting point.

532
00:18:28,160 --> 00:18:29,720
We'll go around once,
then take the zip line.

533
00:18:30,060 --> 00:18:31,290
(High-altitude bungee jump)

534
00:18:31,290 --> 00:18:31,930
This?

535
00:18:33,480 --> 00:18:34,680
That's what this activity is like?

536
00:18:34,680 --> 00:18:35,320
Yeah.

537
00:18:35,320 --> 00:18:37,040
Have you guys ever done via ferrata?

538
00:18:37,040 --> 00:18:37,560
No.

539
00:18:37,560 --> 00:18:38,080
Nope.

540
00:18:38,080 --> 00:18:39,200
I've never even heard of it.

541
00:18:39,200 --> 00:18:40,040
Is it fun?

542
00:18:40,040 --> 00:18:42,480
Yeah, it's fun. It's pretty intense.

543
00:18:44,100 --> 00:18:46,170
Zhao Xilun, I "hate" you.

544
00:18:48,010 --> 00:18:49,600
(Swaying)
Why is it swaying?

545
00:18:49,960 --> 00:18:52,200
I was freaking out.

546
00:18:52,720 --> 00:18:54,000
Si, Xing, would you guys dare to do it?

547
00:18:54,880 --> 00:18:55,760
I've never tried it.

548
00:18:55,760 --> 00:18:57,440
But I guess

549
00:18:57,440 --> 00:18:58,600
I'd give it a try.

550
00:18:59,160 --> 00:19:00,360
You two are pretty brave.

551
00:19:00,360 --> 00:19:01,160
Yeah, that's brave.

552
00:19:01,160 --> 00:19:02,680
Did you jump back then?

553
00:19:02,680 --> 00:19:03,920
I did.

554
00:19:03,920 --> 00:19:05,240
I think I'd dare to do it.

555
00:19:05,240 --> 00:19:06,160
You're not afraid of heights?

556
00:19:06,160 --> 00:19:07,120
I am.

557
00:19:07,120 --> 00:19:08,200
I'd just scream my head off

558
00:19:08,200 --> 00:19:08,880
and then jump.

559
00:19:11,860 --> 00:19:12,980
Come on, let's get ready.

560
00:19:13,060 --> 00:19:14,100
(Ready to go)

561
00:19:14,100 --> 00:19:14,820
Take it slow.

562
00:19:15,600 --> 00:19:16,340
Just one step.

563
00:19:16,340 --> 00:19:17,440
Just this one.

564
00:19:17,930 --> 00:19:18,510
Here, watch out.

565
00:19:18,510 --> 00:19:19,120
Don't scrape against this.

566
00:19:20,890 --> 00:19:21,600
You got this.

567
00:19:22,030 --> 00:19:22,320
You can do it.

568
00:19:22,320 --> 00:19:23,500
Help!

569
00:19:23,500 --> 00:19:24,480
(Zhao Xilun. I think you can do it.)
This is way too high.

570
00:19:24,480 --> 00:19:27,220
It's insanely high.
I'm freaking terrified.

571
00:19:27,220 --> 00:19:28,660
(Under professional supervision.
Do not imitate.)

572
00:19:28,660 --> 00:19:29,340
Hold on with both hands.

